        "original_id": "116ce373-522d-5d84-9e5e-45488f7b698d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Israeli presidential election, 2000\n- People: Ezer Weizman\n- Roles: President of Israel\n- Organizations: Knesset\n\nFacts:\n- Ezer Weizman was first elected President of Israel in 1993.\n- Ezer Weizman was re-elected President of Israel in 1998.\n- Elections for the President of Israel were held in the Knesset on 31 July 2000.\n- The 31 July 2000 Israeli presidential election followed Ezer Weizman's resignation.\n- Ezer Weizman was the seventh President of Israel.\n- Ezer Weizman lived from 15 June 1924 to 24 April 2005.",
